[
 {
  "id": "001",
  "timestamp": "0:00",
  "narration": "Sneako has been banned from YouTube, Twitch, Kick and TikTok.",
  "job_id": "0605d776-191e-4216-b7c2-6db906d2a472",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204203_0605d776-191e-4216-b7c2-6db906d2a472.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "002",
  "timestamp": "0:05",
  "narration": "That used to be the craziest thing about him.",
  "job_id": "eae76fa2-9e12-471d-bd28-815745339554",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204203_eae76fa2-9e12-471d-bd28-815745339554.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "003",
  "timestamp": "0:08",
  "narration": "In 2026, he got banned from an entire country.",
  "job_id": "ad8098e4-dad1-4959-b78c-c1c83a83c4a5",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204203_ad8098e4-dad1-4959-b78c-c1c83a83c4a5.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "004",
  "timestamp": "0:14",
  "narration": "The richest man alive has publicly said he should be deported.",
  "job_id": "a1d8086b-e7ff-4d40-9633-ce3fe0b711c8",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204307_a1d8086b-e7ff-4d40-9633-ce3fe0b711c8.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "005",
  "timestamp": "0:19",
  "narration": "His former best friend is accusing him of something from a prison cell.",
  "job_id": "7d5989bc-f0d7-47b3-abc0-0fa99e366d01",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204204_7d5989bc-f0d7-47b3-abc0-0fa99e366d01.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "006",
  "timestamp": "0:25",
  "narration": "Some of the loudest people on the right want him gone, and so do people on the left.",
  "job_id": "45cc7012-e1cb-49b6-970d-c928855abb2e",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204202_45cc7012-e1cb-49b6-970d-c928855abb2e.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "007",
  "timestamp": "0:32",
  "narration": "This is how one streamer managed to make enemies with almost everyone in a single year.",
  "job_id": "38af9c4c-37b4-44a9-ae3c-9d82e3a3c88c",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204203_38af9c4c-37b4-44a9-ae3c-9d82e3a3c88c.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "008",
  "timestamp": "0:40",
  "narration": "Let's start in April.",
  "job_id": "cec6073b-c8c1-4c9d-9ded-a0b84b8b184a",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204203_cec6073b-c8c1-4c9d-9ded-a0b84b8b184a.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "009",
  "timestamp": "0:41",
  "narration": "Sneako is livestreaming in New York, walking down the street looking at his phone.",
  "job_id": "8035db04-4cf5-4f32-b38d-8038403d1d55",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204307_8035db04-4cf5-4f32-b38d-8038403d1d55.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "010",
  "timestamp": "0:47",
  "narration": "A man walks up and punches him in the face, then drags him to the ground, all on his own stream.",
  "job_id": "3b711f22-d79f-49fb-bd3e-b3a85a76a95e",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204307_3b711f22-d79f-49fb-bd3e-b3a85a76a95e.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "011",
  "timestamp": "0:54",
  "narration": "Sneako comes back online about an hour later, chipped tooth, saying he's fine.",
  "job_id": "98de0c82-a43c-4285-8d51-76a23b39f61f",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204308_98de0c82-a43c-4285-8d51-76a23b39f61f.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "012",
  "timestamp": "1:00",
  "narration": "For most streamers, getting attacked live on camera would be the story of the year.",
  "job_id": "9a2e3fe8-4a9b-497d-a469-6406ee35194b",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204307_9a2e3fe8-4a9b-497d-a469-6406ee35194b.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "013",
  "timestamp": "1:07",
  "narration": "For Sneako, it was April.",
  "job_id": "206f7cbe-3c3c-4021-acb5-bb3eca042461",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204306_206f7cbe-3c3c-4021-acb5-bb3eca042461.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "014",
  "timestamp": "1:10",
  "narration": "Because in May, he flew to Australia.",
  "job_id": "9a52457f-80a1-4e29-8afc-3c813462845f",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204308_9a52457f-80a1-4e29-8afc-3c813462845f.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "015",
  "timestamp": "1:13",
  "narration": "He had a valid visa.",
  "job_id": "c9bce131-4f61-4fa9-8dcd-95ba055b7fdf",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204342_c9bce131-4f61-4fa9-8dcd-95ba055b7fdf.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "016",
  "timestamp": "1:16",
  "narration": "Then the Australian government cancelled it and kicked him out, citing antisemitic and racist content.",
  "job_id": "b056efde-ef85-4619-9c4b-8f8faf860980",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204343_b056efde-ef85-4619-9c4b-8f8faf860980.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "017",
  "timestamp": "1:24",
  "narration": "And it wasn't a temporary ban.",
  "job_id": "c48bb4bb-fb1a-421a-8fd3-81306e0c74d4",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204432_c48bb4bb-fb1a-421a-8fd3-81306e0c74d4.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "018",
  "timestamp": "1:27",
  "narration": "Under a law Australia had just updated, he can never apply for a visa there again. For life.",
  "job_id": "15539451-a1c7-4b3a-a608-df69eaf029d9",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204432_15539451-a1c7-4b3a-a608-df69eaf029d9.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "019",
  "timestamp": "1:36",
  "narration": "Then came the World Cup.",
  "job_id": "700a56c4-2383-4fa5-bc91-a194fe8b9331",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204432_700a56c4-2383-4fa5-bc91-a194fe8b9331.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "020",
  "timestamp": "1:38",
  "narration": "Egypt beats Australia, and Sneako is out in the streets of New York celebrating on stream.",
  "job_id": "03b1b448-0e05-45ba-acd9-6a5c781aee89",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204433_03b1b448-0e05-45ba-acd9-6a5c781aee89.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "021",
  "timestamp": "1:45",
  "narration": "He declares the city an \"Islamic Republic,\" and the clip explodes, tens of millions of views across platforms.",
  "job_id": "f47bad08-cb7f-408a-baad-c110114bee28",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204433_f47bad08-cb7f-408a-baad-c110114bee28.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "022",
  "timestamp": "1:55",
  "narration": "Alex Jones reposts it and demands the Trump administration deport him.",
  "job_id": "260894d5-7a08-4776-b52c-5577227b8ba3",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204526_260894d5-7a08-4776-b52c-5577227b8ba3.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "023",
  "timestamp": "2:00",
  "narration": "Elon Musk replies with one word: yes.",
  "job_id": "80269761-efc4-4e91-8e5f-14adaea0c926",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204526_80269761-efc4-4e91-8e5f-14adaea0c926.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "024",
  "timestamp": "2:04",
  "narration": "Here's the problem.",
  "job_id": "34f6021b-21e7-4c5e-b91c-3f197e7f5518",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204528_34f6021b-21e7-4c5e-b91c-3f197e7f5518.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "025",
  "timestamp": "2:06",
  "narration": "Sneako was born in New York. He's an American citizen.",
  "job_id": "bd1b84fa-b936-417b-a48b-50adf61c8ccb",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204526_bd1b84fa-b936-417b-a48b-50adf61c8ccb.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "026",
  "timestamp": "2:11",
  "narration": "You can't deport a citizen.",
  "job_id": "b9a9afe2-ecbb-46f8-8568-73024267eeec",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204527_b9a9afe2-ecbb-46f8-8568-73024267eeec.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "027",
  "timestamp": "2:15",
  "narration": "Sneako knows this, and he doesn't back down.",
  "job_id": "5d2d9459-173b-4b82-a2e3-8e51c2ae7916",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204527_5d2d9459-173b-4b82-a2e3-8e51c2ae7916.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "028",
  "timestamp": "2:18",
  "narration": "He tells Musk, who was born in South Africa, to go back to Africa.",
  "job_id": "56cb38da-fc55-4473-94e7-5bf58e196ba2",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204626_56cb38da-fc55-4473-94e7-5bf58e196ba2.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "029",
  "timestamp": "2:23",
  "narration": "Then it becomes a full feud.",
  "job_id": "2ad0473c-523b-46d9-bc0e-ab0c4e46c223",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204626_2ad0473c-523b-46d9-bc0e-ab0c4e46c223.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "030",
  "timestamp": "2:27",
  "narration": "Laura Loomer calls for his deportation too.",
  "job_id": "c6f7ddf4-3b52-44da-90c3-0a6fd60c75e5",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204719_c6f7ddf4-3b52-44da-90c3-0a6fd60c75e5.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "031",
  "timestamp": "2:30",
  "narration": "Nick Fuentes, who used to be in the same online circles, starts selling \"Deport Sneako\" merch.",
  "job_id": "4e268aeb-b18e-4f22-9b1c-5032e4a1eaf9",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204627_4e268aeb-b18e-4f22-9b1c-5032e4a1eaf9.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "032",
  "timestamp": "2:38",
  "narration": "At the end of July, Musk goes further.",
  "job_id": "58c9dbf1-0ea5-46db-98f7-315da927eaf7",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204625_58c9dbf1-0ea5-46db-98f7-315da927eaf7.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "033",
  "timestamp": "2:42",
  "narration": "Someone posts that Sneako needs to be deported, and Musk answers: \"He will be.\"",
  "job_id": "d9e310c0-f66c-436c-acbd-81378cdd9dbe",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204718_d9e310c0-f66c-436c-acbd-81378cdd9dbe.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "034",
  "timestamp": "2:48",
  "narration": "Two days later, Sneako fires back.",
  "job_id": "48200344-dfc3-426a-9615-f224e50fbf6d",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204625_48200344-dfc3-426a-9615-f224e50fbf6d.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "035",
  "timestamp": "2:51",
  "narration": "The richest man in the world keeps promising to deport him, he says, and nothing has happened.",
  "job_id": "83bb6a9b-ce85-4c02-9a61-942601250583",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204719_83bb6a9b-ce85-4c02-9a61-942601250583.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "036",
  "timestamp": "2:59",
  "narration": "And he's right. Nothing can.",
  "job_id": "ff11827b-7b82-4a42-bc96-b1f8048b3334",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204719_ff11827b-7b82-4a42-bc96-b1f8048b3334.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "037",
  "timestamp": "3:03",
  "narration": "But the biggest betrayal was still coming.",
  "job_id": "c24e5e39-be42-4de3-bc08-d759b263f088",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204719_c24e5e39-be42-4de3-bc08-d759b263f088.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "038",
  "timestamp": "3:07",
  "narration": "For years, Sneako and Andrew Tate were basically a package deal.",
  "job_id": "2e5b13a4-2986-497a-ac9f-406325824384",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204805_2e5b13a4-2986-497a-ac9f-406325824384.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "039",
  "timestamp": "3:13",
  "narration": "Same audience, same streams, same enemies.",
  "job_id": "3618e353-a42e-4ced-851e-f6b2ee60dcd6",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204805_3618e353-a42e-4ced-851e-f6b2ee60dcd6.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "040",
  "timestamp": "3:16",
  "narration": "Now Tate is sitting in a Miami jail cell waiting to be extradited to the UK,",
  "job_id": "1cbc6a83-38cd-4c2e-b6c8-ee99ba96f937",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204805_1cbc6a83-38cd-4c2e-b6c8-ee99ba96f937.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "041",
  "timestamp": "3:22",
  "narration": "and he's accusing Sneako of trying to sleep with him.",
  "job_id": "c9df191c-8c31-4dbb-b102-011b1b333c99",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204805_c9df191c-8c31-4dbb-b102-011b1b333c99.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "042",
  "timestamp": "3:27",
  "narration": "Sneako denies it completely.",
  "job_id": "dd89cd76-023d-4794-accf-7763c226a097",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204849_dd89cd76-023d-4794-accf-7763c226a097.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "043",
  "timestamp": "3:30",
  "narration": "And in a long interview with Andrew Callaghan of Channel 5, he goes further than he ever has.",
  "job_id": "8a008528-2c45-4e82-bb7e-3a3bf4db537f",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204851_8a008528-2c45-4e82-bb7e-3a3bf4db537f.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "044",
  "timestamp": "3:37",
  "narration": "He says he's done with Tate, and he calls the whole manosphere a kind of militant \"feminism for men.\"",
  "job_id": "58b5b960-4258-4270-a19e-6ca59c156e28",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204851_58b5b960-4258-4270-a19e-6ca59c156e28.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "045",
  "timestamp": "3:46",
  "narration": "Think about that.",
  "job_id": "9f78d0dc-8848-4b5a-8ac5-7f02dec1e503",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204849_9f78d0dc-8848-4b5a-8ac5-7f02dec1e503.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "046",
  "timestamp": "3:47",
  "narration": "This is the guy who helped build that world, now calling it fake.",
  "job_id": "0870a431-19b6-4fef-9e6a-eaeecfd24a2c",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204947_0870a431-19b6-4fef-9e6a-eaeecfd24a2c.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "047",
  "timestamp": "3:52",
  "narration": "And just when it looked like September couldn't get weirder, a crypto casino posts an AI video of Sneako praying on top of a blackjack table.",
  "job_id": "f4c19691-e950-4d98-ac17-f4895bb8e50b",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204947_f4c19691-e950-4d98-ac17-f4895bb8e50b.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "048",
  "timestamp": "4:03",
  "narration": "Sneako, who is Muslim, says he has nothing to do with them and calls the clip disrespectful.",
  "job_id": "80f4b3c8-d799-4b6c-a223-8a5e473f7cbf",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20261002_204946_80f4b3c8-d799-4b6c-a223-8a5e473f7cbf.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "049",
  "timestamp": "4:10",
